%[text] # Edge Detection Theory
%[text] [⇦ Main Menu](file:../../MainMenu.m)
%[text] This script introduces edge detection theory, a key computer vision technique for identifying object boundaries and extracting structural information from images.
%[text]{"align":"center"} ![Image of a ramp edge with a horizontal line drawn across.](text:image:2cee)
%[text:tableOfContents]{"heading":"Table of Contents"} %[text:anchor:M_597CA885]
%[text] %[text:anchor:H_51183E7B] **Before you get started:**
